+ Every year, colleagues from the State Plant Protection Service carry out soil monitoring for agrochemical research on agricultural land. The monitoring has been carried out since 2009 and the data is available on the portal. It should be noted that the aim of the monitoring is to obtain information on the agrochemical performance of a representative sample of farms within the national planning regions, taking into account the farming system and farm specialisation. 
